│ patch_description        │ This implementation doubles the CRX ring entanglement layer while maintaining parameter   │
│                          │ efficiency through parameter sharing. The ansatz begins with independent RY rotations on  │
│                          │ all qubits, followed by two layers of ring-structured CRX gates where the second layer    │
│                          │ reuses the parameters of the first (crx_0 through crx_7). This increases entanglement     │
│                          │ depth without adding parameters, potentially improving expressivity and training          │
│                          │ convergence while maintaining the same number of parameters as the previous version. The  │
│                          │ final RZ layer provides additional local expressivity.                                    │
