│                          │ and disrupted the effective parameter learning.                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ I have reverted to a refined version of the high-performing structure. By using `CRY`     │
│                          │ (parameterized rotation in Y) instead of `CRX`, I provide more relevant entanglement for  │
│                          │ the binary classifier, as the feature map uses `IsingZZ` couplings which are inherently   │
│                          │ Z-basis rotations. This design maintains the optimal parameter count (24 per block, 146   │
│                          │ total), ensures strong connectivity via the ring topology, and minimizes circuit depth to │
